{"id":"defdb06c-2a20-4bf1-a874-f14b582a689b","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:25:49.667Z","batchId":"states_claude-opus-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-opus-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"states","prompt":"Two states for a file list: an empty state with an upload call to action, and an error state with a retry button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Project files</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Two states of the file list for the “Q3 Brand Refresh” workspace: what people see before anything is uploaded, and what they see when files fail to load.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"tablist\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" id=\"tab-empty\" onclick=\"showState('empty')\">Empty state</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" id=\"tab-error\" onclick=\"showState('error')\">Error state</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"state-empty\">\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Files</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">0 files · 0 MB of 10 GB used</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Empty</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:0%\"></div></div>\n    <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg center\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:2.5rem 1rem;\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 auto;\">↑</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">No files yet</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Upload logos, brand guidelines, or campaign assets so your team can find them in one place.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n        <label class=\"btn btn-lg\" style=\"cursor:pointer;\">\n          Upload files\n          <input type=\"file\" multiple style=\"display:none;\" onchange=\"onPick(this)\">\n        </label>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-lg btn-outline\">Create folder</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"pick-msg\">Drag and drop anywhere on this card · PDF, PNG, JPG, SVG, DOCX up to 2 GB each</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"state-error\" style=\"display:none;\">\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\">Files</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Last synced 14 minutes ago</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Unavailable</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"alert alert-destructive stack gap-sm\" role=\"alert\">\n      <strong>We couldn’t load your files</strong>\n      <p class=\"small\">The file service didn’t respond in time (error 504). Your files are safe. Nothing has been deleted.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg center\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:2rem 1rem;\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 auto;\">!</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h3 class=\"h3\">Something went wrong</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">Check your connection, then try again. If this keeps happening, see the status page.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm center\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-lg\" id=\"retry-btn\" onclick=\"retry()\">Retry</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-lg btn-ghost\">View status page</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"retry-msg\">Attempt 1 of 3 · Request ID 7f3a-91c2</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nfunction showState(s){\n  document.getElementById('state-empty').style.display = s==='empty'?'':'none';\n  document.getElementById('state-error').style.display = s==='error'?'':'none';\n  document.getElementById('tab-empty').className = 'btn btn-sm' + (s==='empty'?'':' btn-outline');\n  document.getElementById('tab-error').className = 'btn btn-sm' + (s==='error'?'':' btn-outline');\n}\nfunction onPick(i){\n  var n=i.files.length;\n  document.getElementById('pick-msg').textContent = n ? n+' file'+(n>1?'s':'')+' selected. Uploading…' : 'No files selected.';\n}\nvar attempts=1;\nfunction retry(){\n  var b=document.getElementById('retry-btn'), m=document.getElementById('retry-msg');\n  b.disabled=true; b.textContent='Retrying…';\n  setTimeout(function(){\n    attempts++;\n    b.disabled=false; b.textContent='Retry';\n    m.textContent = attempts<3 ? 'Attempt '+attempts+' of 3 failed · Request ID 7f3a-91c2' : 'Still failing after 3 attempts. Contact support with Request ID 7f3a-91c2.';\n    if(attempts>=3){b.disabled=true;}\n  },1200);\n}\n</script>","deltas":[[1581,"<div"],[1643," class=\"page st"],[1689,"ack g"],[1753,"ap-lg\">\n  <"],[1808,"div class=\"stack g"],[1857,"ap-sm\">\n    <"],[1912,"h1 "],[1958,"class=\"h1\">Project files"],[2008,"</h1>\n    <p"],[2059," class=\"lead mu"],[2108,"ted\">Two states of"],[2439," the file list for"],[2439," the “"],[2439,"Q"],[2439,"3 Brand Ref"],[2439,"resh” workspace: what"],[2439," people"],[2455," see before"],[2508," an"],[2558,"ything is uploaded, and"],[2603," what"],[2655," they see when files"],[2702," f"],[2864,"ail to load.</p>"],[2864,"\n  </div>\n\n  <div"],[2864," class=\"row gap-sm"],[2908,"\" role=\"tablist\">"],[2957,"\n    <button class=\"btn"],[3007," bt"],[3056,"n-sm\" id=\"t"],[3104,"ab-empty\" on"],[3156,"click=\"show"],[3207,"State('empty')\">Emp"],[3256,"ty state</button>\n    <"],[3310,"button class=\"btn btn-"],[3358,"sm b